-- l4 batch reads an enumeration as the name of one of its constructors and
-- refuses anything else, in an input and in a record's field. The rule ends in
-- OTHERWISE, so a value passed through as it stood was answered 2.

DECLARE Party IS ONE OF Landlord, Tenant

DECLARE Lease HAS payer IS A Party

@export Who pays
GIVEN p IS A Party
GIVETH A NUMBER
`who pays` MEANS
  CONSIDER p
  WHEN Landlord THEN 1
  OTHERWISE 2

@export Lease payer
GIVEN l IS A Lease
GIVETH A NUMBER
`lease payer` MEANS `who pays` (l's payer)
